      "title": "ASAM CMP: Adding support for ASAM CMP",
      "message": "ASAM CMP: Adding support for ASAM CMP\n\nThe dissector supports data, control, status, and vendor defined\nmessages. As well as the following technologies:\n- CAN\n- CAN-FD\n- LIN\n- FlexRay\n- Analog\n- UART\n- Ethernet\n",
